# 🤖 Real Estate AI Agents – Tool Calling & Text-to-SQL

AI agents for a real estate company that give exact, data-based answers: they calculate rental yields, search property listings, and answer business questions by writing SQL – with safety guardrails.

## Notebooks
- [Tool_calling_agent.ipynb](Tool_calling_agent.ipynb) – tool calling and a multi-step agent
- [Text_to_sql.ipynb](Text_to_sql.ipynb) – text-to-SQL data agent

## 1. Tool calling agent
- **Yield calculator tool** – exact gross and net rental yield
- **Property search tool** – filters listings by area, price and bedrooms from a plain-English question
- **Agent** – completes multi-step tasks on its own, e.g. "Find 2-bed flats in JVC under 1M and tell me which has the best yield"

## 2. Text-to-SQL data agent
- Turns plain-English questions into **SQL**, runs them, and explains the result
- Handles **JOIN** questions across two tables (properties and sales)
- **Tested 6 / 6**, including a delete attempt (refused) and a question the data can't answer (said so)

## Safety guardrails
- **Read-only** database connection; only single `SELECT` queries allowed
- **Input validation** inside tools
- **Human approval** for risky actions
- **Step limit** on tool calls
- Safety enforced in code, not only in the prompt

## Tech stack
Python · Google Gemini API (function calling) · SQLite · pandas · Google Colab

